"c": "In this unit, you have been introduced to the general classification of computer programming languages, namely, low- level and high-level languages. The two low-level languages are the machine language and the assembly language, the former being the lowest. The machine language, as you have learnt in this unit is the only language understood by the Computer and all other languages have to be translated into the language for the Computer to execute their instructions.",
