"c": "This unit has introduced you to the two common types of variables used in BASIC programming, namely:\n• Numeric Variable\n• String Variable The unit also shows you the various types of characters generally employed in BASIC. As in natural language and in other programming languages, there are specific meanings to keywords in BASIC and the unit has provided you a very extensive list of reserved words used in BASIC",
