"c": "In this unit, you have been introduced to the common statements you are going to frequently use in BASIC programming. The most common BASIC Interpreters today are the Microsoft QuickBasic and Turbo BASIC Interpreters with the latter having a menu facility to compile your BASIC code into an executable file. Remember that in",
