"c": "This unit has taken you through the features of structured programming embedded in Pascal programming language. The iterative structure can be carried out with either the FOR, WHILE or REPEAT statement as you have seen in this unit. The selection structure is implemented in Pascal the same way as in other languages. The unit has shown you the careful manner the ELSE statements should be paired with IF statements.",
"d": []
