"s": "This unit, teaches that Problems that can be solved in polynomial time are called tractable while, that which cannot be solved in polynomial time are intractable The class of decision problem that can be solved in polynomial time by (deterministic) algorithms are called polynomial problems and they are mostly with yes/no answer. Decision problems that can not be solved at all by any algorithm are called undecidable problems.",
